WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,140
Deliberately leading the wrong way won't work

2
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,740
As long as we're close to Oligar

3
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,550
Ji Chuan may find out

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,070
It's not okay to talk things out.

5
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,110
We know Captain Wu is still alive

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:18,970
Know where Oligar is

7
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,490
But he never came to help

8
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:22,900
The leader himself asked

9
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,220
We are still hiding

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,620
This is in the eyes of the base

11
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,740
What is the difference between betrayal and betrayal?

12
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,790
Then there's only one way left, right?

13
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,660
How about we go over with the needle?

14
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:43,640
Anyway, my captain is already crazy somewhere.
